(text "E-STOP (estop_notes v5). VBAT_ESTOP open -> Q 47k/10k releases 555 RESET; TRIG RC (100k/100n) fires one-shot 1.1*200k*10u = 2.2s.\n555 powered from +5V_TRIP (TPS7B6950 from VBAT_P via SS110 + hold-up). BAT54C OR of 555 Q and (MCU_TRIP AND WDO) -> TPS1HTC30 ESTOP_TRIP.\nADDED: 4th LVC1G08 gates MCU_TRIP with WDO. Hold-up cap changed to 50V (BOM 25V part < 30V OV threshold)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7bd02005-28a2-46c8-95c8-448fd1c203df"))
